WEBVTT

00:00:01.865 --> 00:00:03.420
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> What a lovely card!

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:05.829
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, it’s from my family.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.026
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> Can I see?

00:00:07.422 --> 00:00:07.998
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Sure.

00:00:08.713 --> 00:00:10.504
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> Who’s Matt? Is he your brother?

00:00:10.841 --> 00:00:14.921
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, he’s my brother and Kat’s his girlfriend.

00:00:15.328 --> 00:00:16.538
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> How old is Matt?

00:00:16.969 --> 00:00:20.104
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> He’s twenty-nine. No, he’s thirty.

00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:21.662
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> What about Leila?

00:00:21.984 --> 00:00:23.088
Is she your sister?

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:27.045
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, Leila’s my brother Tom’s wife.

00:00:27.522 --> 00:00:29.322
And Aisha’s their daughter.

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:31.111
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> Oh yes, I remember.

00:00:31.413 --> 00:00:33.325
The baby in the photo on your phone.

00:00:33.697 --> 00:00:36.440
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes. She’s so beautiful.

00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:38.097
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> So who’s Silvia?

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:39.635
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> She’s my sister.

00:00:39.893 --> 00:00:41.272
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> Is Luke her husband?

00:00:41.718 --> 00:00:45.061
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, he’s her boyfriend – they aren’t married.

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:46.559
Perhaps one day.

00:00:46.872 --> 00:00:48.102
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> And how old’s Silvia?

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.855
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> She’s twenty-six.

00:00:50.264 --> 00:00:51.282
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> And who’s Max?

00:00:51.386 --> 00:00:52.502
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> He’s my dog!

00:00:52.765 --> 00:00:54.341
<v><b>Camille:</b></v> Ah. What kind of dog is he?